#====================================================================
# DRAFT-metamath-cli-read-command-sequence — explicit READ for multi-command CLI tests
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT-metamath-cli-read-command-sequence
trigger_tool:           metamath|conan|test_package|shadow-ci
phase:                  test|runtime|consumer
error_signature:        Expected DBG.*READ|No source file has been read in|couldn't open the file "/"|The source has [0-9]+ statements
severity:               2
category:               cli-tool|testing|conan|ohos
match_keywords:         metamath, READ, VERIFY PROOF, minimal.mm, test_package, absolute path, command arguments, slash, OHOS
title:                  Metamath 多命令 test_package 必须显式 READ 并引用数据库路径

root_cause:             Metamath v0.198 在同时传入多个命令行参数时会逐参数进入命令解析流程，不能依赖裸数据库路径的隐式读取行为；未引用的路径还可能被 READ 命令解析器按斜杠截断。旧版本读取摘要文案也不能作为 v0.198 的稳定断言。
affected_scope:         Metamath 0.198 及同类带命令解释器的 CLI 工具；尤其是 test_package 同时传入输入文件、校验命令和退出命令的场景。
verification_cmd:       output=$("$METAMATH_BIN" "READ \"$DATABASE\"" "VERIFY PROOF *" "EXIT")

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           explicit-cli-command-sequence
rec_description:        使用离线最小数据库；多命令调用显式写 READ，并在命令字符串内部给数据库路径加双引号；只断言版本、语句数和证明验证成功文本。
rec_command:            output=$("$METAMATH_BIN" "READ \"$DATABASE\"" "VERIFY PROOF *" "EXIT")
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               test-package-cli-sequence

fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      device-first-cli-reproduction
fallback_description:   如果主机无法运行 OHOS ELF，保留 can_run() 跨编译跳过逻辑，使用隔离 shadow CI 复现路径、参数和实际输出，不要删除运行时测试。
fallback_command:       sh "$HOME/bin/ohos-test-runner.sh" --path /data/service/hnp/bin -- zsh ci/conan/build_and_test.sh archives/m/metamath/0.198
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:          shadow-ci-runtime-validation

forbid_1_pattern:       "$METAMATH_BIN" "$DATABASE" "VERIFY PROOF *" "EXIT"|grep -F "(READ...) 6 statements"
forbid_1_reason:        裸路径在多命令模式下不会稳定触发读取，旧版摘要文本也不适用于 v0.198。
forbid_1_consequence:   test_package 在设备上可能未读取数据库或因路径截断失败，导致把 CLI 参数错误误判为源码或交叉编译错误。

principles:             explicit-cli-sequence, offline-deterministic-test, device-runtime-evidence
causes:                 []
caused_by:              []
similar_to:             []
conflicts_with:         []
prerequisite_of:        []

doc_file:               knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-metamath-cli-read-command-sequence.md
last_updated:           2026-09-14
source_event:           metamath 0.198 W5 shadow CI first run failed on implicit path/READ handling; second run passed after explicit quoted READ
source_pr:
source_commit:

metrics_success_count:  1
metrics_fail_count:     1
metrics_confidence:     1.0
metrics_last_used:      2026-09-14

draft:                  true
contributor_id:         codex
